  "content": "<!-- Shields - versions, discord etc. -->\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jsg-addon-rings/files/all\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/for_MC-1.20.1-orange\" alt=\"Minecraft Versions\"/></a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.justsgmod.eu/\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/881802052488011837?style=flat-square&label= &logo=discord&color=2D2D2D\" alt=\"Discord invite\"/></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jsg\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/-JustStargateMod-2d2d2d?style=flat-square&logo=Pinboard&logoColor=3c85e6\" alt=\"JSG\"/></a></p>\n\n<!-- Main banner with current version of 1.20.1 -->\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Fredyman95/Repository-of-knowledge/blob/main/cf/destiny.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Destiny Addon\"/>\n\n<!-- Warning JSg is needed -->\n<table style=\"width:100%\">\n  <tr>\n    <th>\n      <h2><p style=\"font-family:monospace;text-align:center\"><strong>重要提示</strong></p></h2>\n    </th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th>\n      <p style=\"font-family:monospace;text-align:center\">\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jsg\">Just Stargate Mod (JSG) 是本模組的必要依賴項。此擴充功能必須與 Just Stargate Mod (JSG) 5.1.0.0 或更高版本搭配使用。</a></p>\n    </th>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n<!-- Minedragon Bust and text -->\n<table style=\"width:100%\">\n  <tr>\n    <td width=\"30%\"> \n      <p><img src=\"https://vzge.me/bust/700/171b6e4003d641feac5aa31658de6832.png\"></p> \n    </td>\n    <td></td>\n    <td width=\"70%\">\n        <h2><strong>《星際之門：宇宙》中的裝置</strong></h2><p style=\"font-family:monospace;text-align:left\">透過 TauriDev 團隊的官方擴充功能，進一步豐富您的 JSG 體驗。此擴充功能將《星際之門：宇宙》中最具標誌性的技術直接整合到您的世界中，包含高品質的支撐架、地板閘門標記等模型。</p>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n&nbsp;\n&nbsp;\n\n<!-- Fredyman Bust and text -->\n<table style=\"width:100%\">\n  <tr>\n    <td width=\"70%\">\n      <h2><strong>積極開發中</strong></h2><p style=\"font-family:monospace;text-align:left\">我們正在不斷擴充軍火庫。未來更新將包含二氧化碳噴口、斜坡和控制台等內容。最重要的是，我們已轉向全面手工製作經濟體系——現在和未來的所有技術項目均可在生存模式中 100% 手工製作。</p>\n    </td>\n    <td></td>\n    <td width=\"30%\"> \n      <p><img src=\"https://vzge.me/bust/700/b9889cd78c4d4b3385bd2c1415363f17.png?y=-40\"></p> \n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n&nbsp;\n&nbsp;\n\n<!-- Trailer-->\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/955/122/trailer.png\" alt=\"Trailer\"/>\n<span><iframe width=\"1000\" height=\"560\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Y708X1U8KME\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span>\n&nbsp;\n&nbsp;\n\n<!-- Support-->\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/956/70/support.png\" alt=\"Support Us\"/>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.paypal.com/donate/?hosted_button_id=ZYD4K634P5HQU\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/956/53/pp.png\" alt=\"paypal button\"/></a></p>\n&nbsp;\n&nbsp;\n\n<!-- Other projects table -->\n<table style=\"width:100%\">\n  <tr><th> \n    <p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/organization/tauri-development\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/955/959/otherprojects.png\"></a></p>\n  </th></tr>\n</table>\n\n<table style=\"width:100%\">\n  <tr>\n    <th> \n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/jsg\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <p><img width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1039/875/638565645126910597.png\"></p>\n      </a>\n    </th>\n    <th> \n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/jsg-addon-rings\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <p><img width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1241/674/256/256/638812183885157132.png\"></p> \n      </a>\n    </th>\n    <th> \n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/jsg-addon-decoration\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <p><img width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1606/785/256/256/639037358820820174.png\"></p> \n      </a>\n    </th>\n    <th> \n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/rsj\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <p><img width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/955/930/logo.png\"></p> \n      </a>\n    </th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th>\n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/jsg\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <strong><p style=\"font-family:monospace;text-align:center\">Just Stargate Mod</p></strong>\n      </a>\n    </th>\n    <th>\n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/jsg-addon-rings\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <strong><p style=\"font-family:monospace;text-align:center\">運輸環擴充功能</p></strong>\n      </a>\n    </th>\n    <th>\n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/jsg-addon-decoration\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <strong><p style=\"font-family:monospace;text-align:center\">裝飾擴充功能</p></strong>\n      </a>\n    </th>\n    <th>\n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/rsj\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <strong><p style=\"font-family:monospace;text-align:center\">紅石留聲機</p></strong>\n      </a>\n    </th>\n  </tr>\n</table>",
